A particle expressing:--
.²1 Sorrow, regret (alas!); {#vayaM bata vidUrataH kamagatA paSoH kanyakA#}
 <ls>Māl. 3. 18</ls>; {#aho bata mahat pApaM kartuM vyavasitA vayam#} <ls>Bg. 1. 45</ls>.
.²2 Pity or compassion; {#kva bata hariRakAnAM jIvitaM cAtilolam#} <ls>Ś. 1. 10</ls>.
.²3 Addressing, calling; {#bata vitarata toyaM toyavAhA nitAntam#} <ls>G. M.</ls>; <ls>R. 9. 47</ls>.
.²4 Joy or satisfaction; {#api bata maDupuryAmAryaputro'DunAste#} <ls>Bhāg. 10. 47. 21</ls>;
 {#aho batAsi spfhaRIyavIryaH#} <ls>Ku. 3. 20</ls>.
.²5 Wonder or surprise; {#vanaje neti balaM batAsti sattve#} <ls>Ki. 13. 8</ls>;
 {#aho bata mahaccitram#} <ls>K. 154</ls>.
.²6 Censure.
.²7 Truth ({#satyArTa#}); {#kalyARI bata gATeyaM lOkikI pratiBAti mAm#}
 <ls>Rām. 5. 34. 6</ls>. For the meanings of {#bata#} with {#aho#} see under {#aho#}.
